      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every task feature is free on the device you use. A free account adds a backup and lets you connect one agent. Plus covers all your devices, three agents, synced files and a longer history." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.subhead. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every task feature is free on the device you use. Plus syncs your list to all your devices and keeps its full history and files. It also lets your agents work without a daily cap." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.subhead. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
